Let's continue plan.

After activating nodes, we do:

12. Load origin payload.
13. Unload origin payload.

But wait, after loading origin payload, origin_availability_locked becomes true (from load). Then unload requires candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha, candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha, origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha (true after load), origin_payload_linked origin_availability_alpha cargo_payload_alpha (true after load), not origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha (currently false). So unload precondition satisfied. Effect: origin_node_ready true, origin_availability_confirmed true, cargo_available true, not origin_payload_linked.

